Managing background tasks

https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yUMjt0AxVHU

1 : Core libraries / system APIs
invoke asynchronously with await, will run on a VM thread.
await File(path).readAsBytes()

2 : short-lived background tasks

invoke with compute(), will spawn a worker isolate
await compute(_applySepia,_image)

3 : Long lived background tasks 
Manually spawn isolate + send message
await Isolate.spawn(_entry,_receivePort.sendPort)
_sendPort.send("make Move")